    "background_story": "Tiger was a rugged and adventurous dog who loved exploring the great outdoors. However, his love for nature often came with a price - a coat infested with pesky ticks. His owner, an avid hiker, would often take Tiger on long treks through the woods, where he'd inevitably pick up unwanted hitchhikers. But Tiger's owner was diligent about deticking, carefully removing each tick and giving Tiger a soothing bath to ease any discomfort. As the years went by, Tiger grew to appreciate the deticking process, knowing it meant he got to spend quality time with his owner and feel refreshed and rejuvenated afterwards. Despite the occasional tick, Tiger lived a happy and healthy life, always ready for the next adventure with his owner by his side.",
